  m_Name: Text_Cook_BarnTip
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Barn sacks turn up at the gang's tent, late, after midnight. Good sacks, Company stitching. And the man who brings them doesn't come over the fence. He walks the fields road like he's on duty. Make of that what you like.
